<meta name="twitter:description" content="Stewart Tabori &amp; Chang. The creator of the popular 1996 video YogaKids is back with her first book. It&#8217;s a wonderfully joyous romp through 50 poses, with more than 150 color photos of young models who smile, scrunch up their noses, and puff out their cheeks. There are encouraging suggestions, helpful advice to parents, useful &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yogajournal.com/lifestyle/balance/yogakids-educating-the-whole-child-through-yoga-by-marsha-wenig/&quot;&gt;Continued&lt;/a&gt;" />
